== state 0 default
enter	Browse services
1-9	Quick select
/	Filter
T	Task definitions explorer
R	Refresh
	
!	Show the full error (when present)
`	Switch mode
ctrl+p	Reopen mode picker
ctrl+s	Pause/resume polling
ctrl+e	Edit config
ctrl+r	Switch AWS region
R	Refresh data
/	Filter/search
esc	Go back
q	Quit
