c	View console output
S	Start instance
X	Stop instance
r	Reboot instance
T	Terminate instance
o	Open linked resource
tab	Switch EC2 resource
j/k	Scroll
g/G	Top/bottom
	
!	Show the full error (when present)
`	Switch mode
ctrl+p	Reopen mode picker
ctrl+s	Pause/resume polling
ctrl+e	Edit config
ctrl+r	Switch AWS region
R	Refresh data
/	Filter/search
esc	Go back
q	Quit
?	Toggle this help
